commit 35df6425662c2fbc7c007f524b450504d3981dac

C03: colloquial identity, «cómo funciona esto» and a comparison without referent are read as what they are (IDENTITY1323)

IDENTITY1146 left three literals open. «to quien chuta eres.» was read as a football question: request_reading now admits one or two words between «quién» and «eres/sos» (and «who the hell are you») as the identity question. «cómo funciona esto» was answered as a plain conversation: it joins the capability tokens (how this works asks what the assistant does). «Tú eres como eso» compares with a referent that was never named: the mind classifies it as an unresolved input (dangling_comparison) and the composer asks what or whom it is compared with, without guessing.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


